# Tracked dev defaults (NO secrets — safe to commit).
#
# In `vite dev` the UI is served on :5173 but the bridge server listens on :8080,
# so the browser connects straight to the bridge. This avoids relying on Vite's
# WebSocket proxy. Override per-machine in an (untracked) .env.local if needed.
#
# In a production build the bridge serves the UI itself (same origin), so the
# app ignores this and uses the page's own host automatically.
VITE_WS_URL=ws://localhost:8080/ws
